{'symbol': 'PSX', 'date': '2021-11-03 14:10:00', 'title': "TRIAL LAWYER MAJED NACHAWATI APPOINTED CO-LEAD COUNSEL IN LITIGATION OVER WEED KILLER'S LINKS TO PARKINSON'S DISEASE", 'text': "CONTRA COSTA, CALIF., NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIAL LAWYER MAJED NACHAWATI HAS BEEN NAMED CO-LEAD COUNSEL FOR CONSOLIDATED LITIGATION IN CALIFORNIA STATE COURT ON BEHALF OF PEOPLE WHO HAVE DEVELOPED PARKINSON'S DISEASE AFTER EXPOSURE TO PARAQUAT-BASED HERBICIDES INCLUDING GRAMOXONE."}